 "caption": "The whole letter in the order of the page: the words typed in clear stand as they are, and each cipher group is decoded with the key. A group whose value is one of the strict values is shown plainly; groups whose value was fixed on the telegram of 15 July or on the letter’s own words are shown as uncertain, as are the 24 in the group after “queja,” (n-d-c-s-e, read tentatively as the end of quejándose) and the typed 48 in situación; the codes 79 and 77 are not read. The cipher words are: enemigo, te pronuncies, temor, situación, calma, prudencia, oficios, clubs, Guadalajara.",
